{"matched":116,"pages":[{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1564_p0001a01","n":"0001a","t":"中論卷第一釋僧叡序中論有"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1564_p0001b01","n":"0001b","t":"盡矣文或左右未盡善也百論"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1564_p0001c01","n":"0001c","t":"像法中人根轉鈍深著諸法求"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1564_p0002a01","n":"0002a","t":"則不應無先有今無是即為斷"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1564_p0002b01","n":"0002b","t":"而實不爾是故不來問曰若不"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1564_p0002c01","n":"0002c","t":"四緣生諸法更無第五緣一切"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1564_p0003a01","n":"0003a","t":"一一破諸緣答曰若果非有生"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1564_p0003b01","n":"0003b","t":"者如諸佛所說真實微妙法於"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1564_p0003c01","n":"0003c","t":"法無法何能生是故果不從緣"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1564_p0004a01","n":"0004a","t":"是故當知去時有去答曰云何"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1564_p0004b01","n":"0004b","t":"無有去者何以故若有去者則"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1564_p0004c01","n":"0004c","t":"一切無有發何故而分別若人"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1564_p0005a01","n":"0005a","t":"亦不住何以故因去法滅故有"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1564_p0005b01","n":"0005b","t":"如是二俱有過何以故若去法"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1564_p0005c01","n":"0005c","t":"身動三種名未去已去去時若"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1564_p0006a01","n":"0006a","t":"眼耳及鼻舌身意等六情此眼"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1564_p0006b01","n":"0006b","t":"者無見相是故偈中說若已破"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1564_p0006c01","n":"0006c","t":"法中虛空時方神微塵涅槃等"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1564_p0007a01","n":"0007a","t":"然是故有智者不應分別色若"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1564_p0007b01","n":"0007b","t":"問難同彼所疑若依空破常者"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1564_p0007c01","n":"0007c","t":"常相因待故離有相無相法更"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1564_p0008a01","n":"0008a","t":"凡夫悕望為有是故先破復次"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1564_p0008b01","n":"0008b","t":"者染法亦如是若先離人定有"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1564_p0008c01","n":"0008c","t":"若染染者先有決定異相而後"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1564_p0009a01","n":"0009a","t":"中論卷第二龍樹菩薩造梵志"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1564_p0009b01","n":"0009b","t":"若謂一一者於一處中或有有"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1564_p0009c01","n":"0009c","t":"本生不能生生生問曰是生生"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1564_p0010a01","n":"0010a","t":"燈在於此間則破一切闇若燈"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1564_p0010b01","n":"0010b","t":"生謂生者法或可生已而生或"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1564_p0010c01","n":"0010c","t":"故住滅亦不成生住滅不成故"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1564_p0011a01","n":"0011a","t":"有非如現在相以現在相故說"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1564_p0011b01","n":"0011b","t":"不住法不住無住相故住法亦"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1564_p0011c01","n":"0011c","t":"若法已滅則不滅以先滅故未"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1564_p0012a01","n":"0012a","t":"譬如第二頭無故不可斷法若"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1564_p0012b01","n":"0012b","t":"已如夢中所見不應求實如乾"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1564_p0012c01","n":"0012c","t":"即為無因離作業有作者離作"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1564_p0013a01","n":"0013a","t":"云何可得作如是則破罪福等"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1564_p0013b01","n":"0013b","t":"無人但從眾緣生如受受者餘"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1564_p0013c01","n":"0013c","t":"細密覆故亦應不可壞而今實"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1564_p0014a01","n":"0014a","t":"諸根不以本住故知是故偈中"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1564_p0014b01","n":"0014b","t":"四大中亦無本住問曰若眼耳"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1564_p0014c01","n":"0014c","t":"便是受者汝言破即為自破燃"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1564_p0015a01","n":"0015a","t":"爾時但有薪何物燃可燃若謂"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1564_p0015b01","n":"0015b","t":"有可燃何以故可燃在先燃在"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1564_p0015c01","n":"0015c","t":"是過先已說復次燃不餘處來"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1564_p0016a01","n":"0016a","t":"相是善是不善是無記是有漏"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1564_p0016b01","n":"0016b","t":"一時成者是亦有過何以故生"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1564_p0016c01","n":"0016c","t":"因有此陰故而有彼陰生若苦"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1564_p0017a01","n":"0017a","t":"相復次自作若不成云何彼作"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1564_p0017b01","n":"0017b","t":"所謂涅槃非妄取相以是經說"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1564_p0017c01","n":"0017c","t":"相續問曰我不說滅不滅故相"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1564_p0018a01","n":"0018a","t":"識是故當知識不住故無自性"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1564_p0018b01","n":"0018b","t":"是故無性如嬰兒定住自性者"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1564_p0018c01","n":"0018c","t":"是事不然何以故乳與酪有種"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1564_p0019a01","n":"0019a","t":"三事無異法故則無合無合義"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1564_p0019b01","n":"0019b","t":"異法當有合見等無有異異相"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1564_p0019c01","n":"0019c","t":"而有不能獨成今異法中無異"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1564_p0020a01","n":"0020a","t":"眾緣若從眾緣出當知無真性"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1564_p0020b01","n":"0020b","t":"佛能滅有無如化迦旃延經中"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1564_p0020c01","n":"0020c","t":"是則墮常見若法先有敗壞而"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1564_p0021a01","n":"0021a","t":"應復從身至身若先無身則無"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1564_p0021b01","n":"0021b","t":"煩惱者則應以煩惱縛五陰而"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1564_p0021c01","n":"0021c","t":"益他亦名慈善福德亦名今世"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1564_p0022a01","n":"0022a","t":"者從殺生若射不殺射者但得"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1564_p0022b01","n":"0022b","t":"生不殺不盜不邪婬不妄語不"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1564_p0022c01","n":"0022c","t":"如是二種業現世受果報或言"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1564_p0023a01","n":"0023a","t":"諸業亦不滅以其不生故若業"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1564_p0023b01","n":"0023b","t":"煩惱諸業空何況於諸身諸賢"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1564_p0023c01","n":"0023c","t":"變化人所作是則名為業諸煩"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1564_p0024a01","n":"0024a","t":"諸佛或說我或說於無我諸法"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1564_p0024b01","n":"0024b","t":"如國無鍮石喻之如金四名賢"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1564_p0024c01","n":"0024c","t":"我無我所者能真見諸法凡夫"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1564_p0025a01","n":"0025a","t":"何故說一切心行滅答曰諸法"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1564_p0025b01","n":"0025b","t":"為破四種貪著故說而此中於"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1564_p0025c01","n":"0025c","t":"中論觀時品第十九六偈問曰"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1564_p0026a01","n":"0026a","t":"時不成不因現在時則過去未"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1564_p0026b01","n":"0026b","t":"中論觀因果品第二十二十四"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1564_p0026c01","n":"0026c","t":"是因有二體一與一則滅若因"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1564_p0027a01","n":"0027a","t":"為果是前生因應還更生但是"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1564_p0027b01","n":"0027b","t":"不與未來現在過去因合現在"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1564_p0027c01","n":"0027c","t":"若果定無性因為何所生因不"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1564_p0028a01","n":"0028a","t":"不離異若壞離異壞則無因是"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1564_p0028b01","n":"0028b","t":"有何咎答曰若離於成壞是亦"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1564_p0028c01","n":"0028c","t":"法生法若至若失是則無因無"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1564_p0029a01","n":"0029a","t":"有人雖信受分別說諸法而不"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1564_p0029b01","n":"0029b","t":"有不滅無有後有問曰後有不"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1564_p0029c01","n":