/T30n1564_p0037a01","n":"0037a","t":"有邊等諸見皆依未來世我於"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1564_p0037b01","n":"0037b","t":"謂先世我不作今我如人浣衣"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1564_p0037c01","n":"0037c","t":"觸有力故能治舍汝所說我無"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1564_p0038a01","n":"0038a","t":"或時無用如蒲桃漿持戒者應"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1564_p0038b01","n":"0038b","t":"世我異者應離彼我而有今我"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1564_p0038c01","n":"0038c","t":"若常及無常是二俱成者如是"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1564_p0039a01","n":"0039a","t":"從五陰復生五陰是五陰次第"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1564_p0039b01","n":"0039b","t":"得亦常亦無常受亦如是云何"}],"scheme":"cbeta","slug":"cbeta-T-T30n1564-中論","source":"CBETA T30n1564 @ xml-p5 dbdea41","total":117,"unit":"T30 頁欄"}